OL,3,GNEWSAFormer care home reduced to
OL,4,Acharred shell after fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire has swept through a former care
OL,7,Fhome, reducing it to a smouldering
OL,8,Fruin.
OL,10,FMore than 60 firefighters from 13 fire
OL,11,Fstations across Hampshire were sent to
OL,12,Fthe derelict building on London Road in
OL,13,FLiss at about 23:15 BST on Tuesday.
OL,15,FCrews worked through the night to
OL,16,Ftackle the flames as they spread
OL,17,Fthrough all floors and the roof, while
OL,18,Fparts of the building collapsed,
OL,19,Fsending debris and embers falling to
OL,20,Fthe ground.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
