OL,3,GNEWSAFormer care home reduced to
OL,4,Acharred shell after fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FHampshire fire service said no injuries
OL,7,Fwere reported but that the building had
OL,8,Fbeen completely destroyed. Crews remain
OL,9,Fat the scene and people are being urged
OL,10,Fto avoid the area while several road
OL,11,Fclosures remain in place.
